# Live Google reviews on the homepage testimonials section.
# Without these, the site falls back to the static testimonials in content/home.ts.
#
# 1. Create/select a project in Google Cloud Console, enable the "Places API",
#    and create an API key (restrict it to the Places API + your domain).
# 2. Find the Place ID for Cityview Bar & Lodge using Google's Place ID finder:
#    https://developers.google.com/maps/documentation/places/web-service/place-id
#    (search "Cityview Bar & Lodge, Isolo Egbe Rd, Ejigbo, Lagos")
GOOGLE_PLACES_API_KEY=
GOOGLE_PLACE_ID=
